docs/observability.md:258:Each scripted workflow stores runtime artifacts under a workflow artifact directory. The on-disk directory is still named `chain-runs` for compatibility. With the default `artifactDir: "session"` or with `"temp"`, it is user-scoped temp storage. With `artifactDir: "project"`, the root is `<cwd>/.pi/subagents/chain-runs/`:
